<title>LITHUANIA: VILNIAUS VINGIS POSTS LOSS, SALES RISE.</title>
<headline>VILNIAUS VINGIS POSTS LOSS, SALES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian electronic components producer Vilniaus Vingis said on Thursday that its sales for the first four months of 1997 rose by 28 percent compared to the same period last year to 20.7 million litas.</p>
</text>
